{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792663965004,"sessionID":"ses_e9cf132deffe15nAQiy0AW84Er","part":{"partID":"prt_163187812001FVfr24aPQCcMwr","sessionID":"ses_e9cf132deffe15nAQiy0AW84Er","messageID":"msg_16317ba610010QV7YVxFEaV7F3","type":"tool","id":"call_00_DppKlmPQWHVz7IXdVILw3982","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/baptistefaisy/hackathon-memory && echo \"=== git (attendu: pas un depot) ===\" && (git status --porcelain 2>&1 | head -3); echo \"=== historique: entree de reference inchangee ===\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py get \"Test — timeout de connexion PostgreSQL\" 2>&1 | head -6; echo \"=== nb entrees ===\" && .venv/bin/python scripts/historique_client.py liste 2>&1 | wc -l","timeout":120000},"output":"=== git (attendu: pas un depot) ===\nfatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git\n=== historique: entree de reference inchangee ===\nTest — timeout de connexion PostgreSQL\nCause racine : pool de connexions sature. Correctif : augmenter max_connections et liberer les connexions en fin de requete.\n--- resolution complementaire 2026-10-22 07:53 ---\nResolution complementaire : connexions non rendues au pool. Corriger avec un bloc finally autour de chaque usage de connexion.\n=== nb entrees ===\n5\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== git (attendu: pas un depot) ===\nfatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git\n=== historique: entree de reference inchangee ===\nTest — timeout de connexion PostgreSQL\nCause racine : pool de connexions sature. Correctif : augmenter max_connections et liberer les connexions en fin de requete.\n--- resolution complementaire 2026-10-22 07:53 ---\nResolution complementaire : connexions non rendues au pool. Corriger avec un bloc finally autour de chaque usage de connexion.\n=== nb entrees ===\n5\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"provi